                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Man i wish i had friends(don't send me ur discord). Cause this game nails a fps shooter married to the Mario Party minigame aesthetic. Silent hill, rising platforms, skiing, this game nails the concept with two caveats.\n1.) Base mobility is slow AF, i get it for the silent hill inspired minigame but mobility should increase for the other minigames with the exception of the ornament minigame\n2.) Hit detection and aiming aren't perfect\n\nReview Score- 8 out of 10",
